  - nodes:
    - id: node6a_stunspecialist
      nodeName: Stun Specialist
      description: Attack Damage increased by 25%, Total Attack Speed reduced by 50%, Stun Chance increased by 15%. Attacks deal AoE damage (50% of the original damage to secondary targets), and can also stun - if the main target gets stunned, all targets in the AoE get stunned too.
